<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65234" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾰτάω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάτην</span>):—poet. Verb, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be idle, dally</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπέκοψε παρήορον οὐδὲ μάτησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.474
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				23.510
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ τὼ μὲν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππω</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> δείσαντε ματήσετον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.233
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ ματᾷ τοὔργον</span> the
			work <i>lags</i> not, goes on apace, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				57
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ματᾶν ὁδῷ</span>
			<i>to loiter</i> by the way, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Th.</u>
				37
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰδώμεθ᾽, εἴ τι τοῦδε φροιμίου
				ματᾷ</span>
			<i>is in vain, is fruitless</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				142
			</span></i>; of persons, <i>fail of</i> a thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.102
			</span></i>.</div>
